@startuml
title SafetyLite kernel services component view

component "Kernel Core" as Kernel <<ARC-Kernel>>
component "Priority Scheduler" as Scheduler <<ARC-Scheduler>>
component "Task Supervisor" as TaskSupervisor <<ARC-TaskSupervisor>>
component "Time Service" as TimeService <<ARC-TimeService>>
component "IPC Manager" as IPC <<ARC-IPC>>
component "Memory Protection Service" as MPU <<ARC-MemoryProtection>>
component "Configuration Manager" as Config <<ARC-ConfigManager>>
component "Mode Manager" as ModeManager <<ARC-ModeManager>>
component "Safety Application API" as AppAPI <<ARC-AppAPI>>

interface TaskControl as ITaskControl
interface TickSource as ITick
interface QueueService as IQueue
interface EventFlagService as IEvent
interface RegionSwitch as IRegion
interface ModeControl as IMode
interface ConfigurationAccess as IConfig

AppAPI --> ITaskControl : activate task
ITaskControl --> Kernel : validate caller
Kernel --> Scheduler : choose next task
Scheduler --> TaskSupervisor : update budget
Scheduler --> TimeService : read tick
Scheduler --> IPC : unblock waiters
Scheduler --> MPU : install memory map
Scheduler --> ModeManager : check service mode
IPC --> IQueue : bounded queue
IPC --> IEvent : event flags
MPU --> IRegion : region switch
Config --> IConfig : task and region table
Kernel --> Config : load configuration
Kernel --> ModeManager : normal/degraded/safe
ModeManager --> IMode : mode state
TimeService --> ITick : monotonic tick

note right of Scheduler: REQ-001 KER-002 KER-003 SAF-005
note right of IPC: REQ-003 KER-005 KER-006
note right of MPU: REQ-002 SAF-003 PLT-003
@enduml
